.chapter "Mathematics"

The roots of $a x sup 2 + b x + c = 0$ are
.EQ (1.1)
x = {- b +- sqrt {b sup 2 - 4ac}} over {2a}
.EN
and a sum, $sum from {i=1} to n i = {n(n+1)} over 2$, inline.
.EQ (1.2)
sum from {k=1} to inf 1 over {k sup 2} = pi sup 2 over 6 ~~~
int from 0 to inf e sup {-x sup 2} dx = sqrt pi over 2
.EN
.EQ
left ( matrix { ccol { a above c } ccol { b above d } } right ) ~
left [ x over y right ] ~ left { pile { 1 above 0 } right "" ~
left | x right | ~ left floor x right floor ~ left ceiling x right ceiling
.EN
.EQ
alpha beta gamma delta ~ phi psi omega ~ GAMMA DELTA SIGMA OMEGA ~
a <= b >= c != d approx e ~ x -> y ~ A union B inter C ~ partial f over partial x
.EN
.EQ
x bar + y hat + z vec + w tilde + v dot + u dotdot
.EN
